    "detailed_description": "Valkyrie Champions is a mission-based Hero Shooter with an emphasis on upgrades and progression. Choose your champion and fight solo or with up to 4 online friends against huge amounts of enemies and ultimately save the lands against evil!<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>- Single player or play online with 4 Steam Friends.<br>- 4 selectable Valkyrie Champions to choose from, each with their own weapon/spell set and unique stats.<br>- Multiple missions with varying difficulty modes to master.<br>- Unlockable weapons and equipment to develop your combat skills.<br>- Challenge a large variety of Monsters and Bosses!<br>- Skill tree to strengthen your characters!",
